bject", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "cocones", "target_term": "余锥"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "cocones", "target_term": "余锥"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "initial object", "target_term": "始对象"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是图表（diagram）。在此情形下，<TEXTITOPEN_0001>锥（cone）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>所对应的图表为<MATH_0002>，它由对象（object）<MATH_0003>及态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>给出，使得对于任意态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>，它属于<MATH_0007>，图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n都是交换的（commutative）。全体锥（cones）构成一个范畴（category），其态射（morphisms）的概念是显然的。显然，<MATH_0009>的极限（limit）（若它存在）是锥（cones）范畴（category）中的终对象（final object）。对偶地，<TEXTITOPEN_0002>余锥（cocone）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>所对应的图表为<MATH_0010>，它由对象（object）<MATH_0011>及态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0012>给出，使得对于任意态射（morphisms）<MATH_0013>，它属于<MATH_0014>，图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0015>\n都交换（commutes）。全体余锥（cocones）构成一个范畴（category），其态射（morphisms）的概念是显然的。与上面类似，<MATH_0016>的余极限（colimit）存在，当且仅当余锥（cocones）范畴（category）有始对象（initial object）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:d82d4ae8561f73543671ae5c78dd2386fa743438e5678f4addc1e30fc183f232", "unit_id": "tag:0G2U:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所给函子图表及交换图；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"context": "本注记定义的图表上的锥；暂定译法。", "source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥"}, {"context": "锥或余锥的顶点；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "锥或余锥的结构箭头族；暂定译法。", "source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"context": "索引范畴及锥范畴的态射；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "锥条件中的图表性质；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"context": "锥的全体及其范畴；暂定译法。", "source_term": "cones", "target_term": "锥"}, {"context": "锥和余锥构成的范畴；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "由终对象刻画的极限；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "limit", "target_term": "极限"}, {"context": "锥范畴中的终对象；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"context": "本注记定义的对偶结构；暂定译法。", "source_term": "cocone", "target_term": "余锥"}, {"context": "余锥条件中的图表交换性；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"context": "余锥的全体及其范畴；暂定译法。", "source_term": "cocones", "target_term": "余锥"}, {"context": "由始对象刻画的余极限；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"context": "余锥范畴中的始对象；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "initial object", "target_term": "始对象"}]}
